        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Willard Mack, Wilbur Mack, Subhash Ghai, Anant Balani\n- Works: Who's Your Neighbor?, Joggers' Park\n- Roles: actor, film director, producer, screenwriter, writer\n- Topics: Hindi cinema, screen dramas\n\nFacts:\n- Wilbur Mack was a fellow actor who was also born in 1873 and was not a relative of Willard Mack.\n- Subhash Ghai was born on 24 January 1945.\n- Subhash Ghai is an Indian film director, producer, and screenwriter known primarily for his work in Hindi cinema.\n- Who's Your Neighbor? was written by Willard Mack.\n- Who's Your Neighbor? was Willard Mack's first foray into screen dramas.\n- Joggers' Park was directed by Anant Balani.\n- Joggers' Park was written by Subhash Ghai.",
